[I] IBus input method engine for Korean Hangul, using libhangul

[T] ibus-hangul is an IBus input method engine that provides Korean Hangul text
[T] input by using the libhangul library for hangul composition and hanja
[T] conversion.

[U] https://github.com/libhangul/ibus-hangul

